# SentinelPay — Product Requirements Document (PRD)

**Version:** 1.0
**Status:** Active
**Last Updated:** 2026-11-25
**Owner:** [Rajnish Kumar]
**Tagline:** Secure Payments, Intelligent Protection

---

## 1. Vision

Build a production-grade payment infrastructure platform that demonstrates
real-world fintech engineering: safe money movement (double-entry ledger),
zero double-charges (idempotency), real-time fraud detection (ML), and
merchant settlement/reconciliation.

**Not an e-commerce app.** A **payment platform** that other businesses could
theoretically integrate with.

---

## 2. Success Criteria

By end of Phase 3, SentinelPay must:

- Process 1000 TPS in load tests (k6) with <200ms p95 latency
- Demonstrate **zero money loss** under concurrent transaction stress tests
- Fraud model achieve >90% precision on simulated dataset
- Be fully deployed, monitored (Grafana), and CI/CD automated
- Have complete API docs (Swagger) + Postman collection

